    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN THE PERFECT WARRIOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rebel Roar</i> is an action-packed deckbuilder where you strategically combine <strong>animal decks</strong> and <strong>specialty decks</strong> to customize your rebel warriors and engage in intense card battles against the tyrannical Sapiens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Ninja Cat to the Hacker Opossum</strong>, lead the resistance against oppression. Free your fellow animals, forge powerful alliances, and challenge the status quo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A LIVING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the diverse regions of planet Animalek \u2014 liberate its towns, find new allies, grow the rebellion, and earn powerful items to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNDREDS OF CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of cards across more than 10 unique decks, you can combine animal abilities with powerful combat specialties like Hacker, Ninja and Gunner, to create the perfect combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of unlockables \u2014 consoles, stickers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/48abdd53c505309a157e270b0d46744b.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN THE PERFECT WARRIOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rebel Roar</i> is an action-packed deckbuilder where you strategically combine <strong>animal decks</strong> and <strong>specialty decks</strong> to customize your rebel warriors and engage in intense card battles against the tyrannical Sapiens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6972728c5eca026226cf3091562ccf0c.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Ninja Cat to the Hacker Opossum</strong>, lead the resistance against oppression. Free your fellow animals, forge powerful alliances, and challenge the status quo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/04ebbccbf86c70011f5ebc79a5afec3c.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A LIVING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the diverse regions of planet Animalek \u2014 liberate its towns, find new allies, grow the rebellion, and earn powerful items to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/a159e202ee247b789276c4e31d031981.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNDREDS OF CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of cards across more than 10 unique decks, you can combine animal abilities with powerful combat specialties like Hacker, Ninja and Gunner, to create the perfect combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1d7e642d5241a6b47fb9c983d71df1fd.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of unlockables \u2014 consoles, stickers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.poster.avif?t=1754021968\" width=920 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.webm?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/984fd4eb025447fdac6bce69899f6cb4.mp4?t=1754021968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Rebel Roar is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder set in an animal cyberpunk universe. Lead a group of rebel animals, in a revolution against an evil Sapien Corporation. Combine decks to create your perfect warrior: from ninja cat to hacker possum.",
